<concept id="t00932" otherprops="legalnotice_europe-general_egall_2023_20230101_0000925">
    <title>Replacing stop and tail lamp (Bulb type) (Type A)</title>
    <prolog>
        <metadata>
            <keywords>
                <indexterm>replacing stop and tail lamp (bulb type)</indexterm>
            </keywords>
        </metadata>
    </prolog>
    <conbody>
        <table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0" id="table_txr_hdj_pjc">
            <tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
                <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                <tbody>
                    <row rowsep="0">
                        <entry colname="col1">
                            <fig id="fig_uxr_hdj_pjc">
                                <figgroup>
                                    <image href="images/OKA4H073061.jpg" scale="95"
                                        align="center" placement="break" id="image_vxr_hdj_pjc"/>
                                </figgroup>
                            </fig>
                        </entry>
                        <entry colname="col2"/>
                    </row>
                </tbody>
            </tgroup>
        </table>
        <ol id="ol_wxr_hdj_pjc">
            <li>
                <p>Open the tailgate.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Open the service cover.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Loosen the light assembly retaining screws with a cross-tip screwdriver.</p>
                <table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0"
                    id="table_xxr_hdj_pjc">
                    <tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
                        <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                        <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                        <tbody>
                            <row rowsep="0">
                                <entry colname="col1">
                                    <fig id="fig_yxr_hdj_pjc">
                                        <figgroup>
                                            <image href="images/OKA4H073062.jpg"
                                                scale="95" align="center" placement="break"
                                                id="image_zxr_hdj_pjc"/>
                                        </figgroup>
                                    </fig>
                                </entry>
                                <entry colname="col2"/>
                            </row>
                        </tbody>
                    </tgroup>
                </table>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Remove the rear combination lamp assembly from the body of the vehicle.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Disconnect the rear combination lamp connector.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Remove the socket from the assembly by turning the socket counterclockwise until
                    the tabs on the socket align with the slots on the assembly.</p>
                <table outputclass="formatc_none" frame="none" rowsep="0" colsep="0"
                    id="table_ayr_hdj_pjc">
                    <tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="0">
                        <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                        <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="2.343*" colsep="0"/>
                        <tbody>
                            <row rowsep="0">
                                <entry colname="col1">
                                    <fig id="fig_byr_hdj_pjc">
                                        <figgroup>
                                            <image href="images/OKA4H073063.jpg"
                                                scale="95" align="center" placement="break"
                                                id="image_cyr_hdj_pjc"/>
                                        </figgroup>
                                    </fig>
                                </entry>
                                <entry colname="col2">
                                    <fig id="fig_dyr_hdj_pjc">
                                        <figgroup>
                                            <image href="images/OKA4H073064.jpg"
                                                scale="95" align="center" placement="break"
                                                id="image_eyr_hdj_pjc"/>
                                        </figgroup>
                                    </fig>
                                </entry>
                            </row>
                        </tbody>
                    </tgroup>
                </table>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Remove the bulb from the socket by pressing it in and rotating it
                    counterclockwise until the tabs on the bulb align with the slots in the
                    socket.</p>
                <p>Pull the bulb out of the socket.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Insert a new bulb by inserting it into the socket and rotating it until it locks
                    into place.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Install the socket in the assembly by aligning the tabs on the socket with the
                    slots in the assembly.</p>
                <p>Push the socket into the assembly and turn the socket clockwise.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Install the rear combination lamp assembly to the body of the vehicle.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Install the service cover.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </conbody>
